  FT["MY-H6237"] = {"id":"MY-H6237","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 491/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年娱乐税（豁免）令","en":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2021","orig":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2021","ms":"Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian) 2021","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế giải trí (Miễn trừ) năm 2021","th":"คำสั่งภาษีบันเทิง (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Perintah Bea Hiburan (Pembebasan) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA491","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2021_P.U.(A)491-2021_ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2021.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6237-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Hiburan\n\n(Pengecualian) 2021.\n\n(2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 September 2021.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H6237-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Tiket masuk bagi tayangan filem dengan tajuk yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual\n\nyang diadakan dalam tempoh dari 1 September 2021 hingga 31 Disember 2021\n\ndi Pawagam Golden Screen Cinemas (GSC) di Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur dan\n\nPutrajaya dikecualikan daripada duti hiburan.\n\nJADUAL\n\nBil. Tajuk Filem\n\n1 Great White\n\n2 77 Heart Warmings\n\n3 Spiral: From the Book of Saw\n\n4 Those Who Wish Me Dead\n\n5 Thalavii\n\n6 Kodiyil Oruvan\n\n7 Friendship\n\n8 My Love\n\n9 Fate/Grand Order -Divine Realm of the Round Table: Camelor Wandering\n\nAgateram\n\n10 Black Widow\n\nBil. Tajuk Filem\n\n11 Jungle Cruise\n\n12 Malignant\n\n13 Chinese Doctor\n\n14 Ice Road\n\n15 Fate/Grand Order Divine Realm of the Round Table: Camelot Paladin;\n\nAgateram\n\n16 No Time to Die\n\n17 The Suicide Squad\n\n18 Blackpink the Movie\n\n19 Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings\n\n20 \"Kimetsu Orchestra Concert\"\n\n21 Free Guy\n\n22 Dune\n\n23 Halloween Kills\n\n24 Escape Room: Tournament of Champions\n\n25 The Last Duel\n\n26 Tokyo Revengers\n\n27 Fast and Furious 9\n\n28 Ron's Gone Wrong\n\n29 Antlers\n\n30 Don't Breathe 2\n\n31 A Quiet Place 2\n\n32 Sinkhole\n\n33 Sword Art Online Progressive: Aria of Starless Night\n\n34 Eternals\n\n35 The Boss Baby: Family Business\n\n36 Paw Patrol: The Movie\n\n37 Dendam Kesuma\n\n38 Mr. Peyii\n\n39 My Hero Academia World Heroes' Mission\n\n40 Last Night in Soho\n\nBil. Tajuk Filem\n\n41 Guimoon: The Lightless Door\n\n42 King Richard\n\n43 The Medium\n\n44 Candyman\n\n45 Venom: Let There be Carnage\n\n46 Encanto\n\n47 Showtime 1958\n\n48 Fate/Grand Order Final Singularity Grand Temple of Time: SOLOMON\n\n49 Dear Evan Hansen\n\n50 Rumah Maduku Berhantu\n\n51 West Side Story\n\n52 The Addams Family 2\n\n53 Fate/Kaleid Liner Prisma Illya the Movie Licht- The Nameless Girl\n\n54 Spider-Man: No Way Home\n\n55 The Matrix: Resurrections\n\n56 The King's Man\n\n57 Sing 2\n\n58 Emergency Declaration\n\n59 Peter Rabbit 2: The Runaway\n\nDibuat 24 Disember 2021\n\n[Perb.MOF.TAX(S)700-1/3/27 JLD.2(15); PN(PU2)174/XI]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY ACT 1953\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 12(1)(b) of the\n\nEntertainments Duty Act 1953 [Act 103], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Entertainments Duty (Exemption)\n\nOrder 2021.\n\n(2) This Order is deemed to have come into operation on 1 September 2021.\n\nExemption\n\n2. The admission ticket for the movie screenings with the titles specified\n\nin the Schedule which are held within the period from 1 September 2021\n\nuntil 31 December 2021 at the Golden Screen Cinemas (GSC) Cinemas in\n\nthe Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur and Putrajaya are exempted from\n\nentertainments duty.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nNo. Titles of Movies\n\n1 Great White\n\n2 77 Heart Warmings\n\n3 Spiral: From the Book of Saw\n\n4 Those Who Wish Me Dead\n\n5 Thalavii\n\n6 Kodiyil Oruvan\n\n7 Friendship\n\n8 My Love\n\n9 Fate/Grand Order -Divine Realm of the Round Table: Camelor Wandering\n\nAgateram\n\nNo. Titles of Movies\n\n10 Black Widow\n\n11 Jungle Cruise\n\n12 Malignant\n\n13 Chinese Doctor\n\n14 Ice Road\n\n15 Fate/Grand Order Divine Realm of the Round Table: Camelot Paladin; Agateram\n\n16 No Time to Die\n\n17 The Suicide Squad\n\n18 Blackpink the Movie\n\n19 Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings\n\n20 \"Kimetsu Orchestra Concert\"\n\n21 Free Guy\n\n22 Dune\n\n23 Halloween Kills\n\n24 Escape Room: Tournament of Champions\n\n25 The Last Duel\n\n26 Tokyo Revengers\n\n27 Fast and Furious 9\n\n28 Ron's Gone Wrong\n\n29 Antlers\n\n30 Don't Breathe 2\n\n31 A Quiet Place 2\n\n32 Sinkhole\n\n33 Sword Art Online Progressive: Aria of Starless Night\n\n34 Eternals\n\n35 The Boss Baby: Family Business\n\n36 Paw Patrol: The Movie\n\n37 Dendam Kesuma\n\n38 Mr. Peyii\n\n39 My Hero Academia World Heroes' Mission\n\n40 Last Night in Soho\n\nNo. Titles of Movies\n\n41 Guimoon: The Lightless Door\n\n42 King Richard\n\n43 The Medium\n\n44 Candyman\n\n45 Venom: Let There be Carnage\n\n46 Encanto\n\n47 Showtime 1958\n\n48 Fate/Grand Order Final Singularity Grand Temple of Time: SOLOMON\n\n49 Dear Evan Hansen\n\n50 Rumah Maduku Berhantu\n\n51 West Side Story\n\n52 The Addams Family 2\n\n53 Fate/Kaleid Liner Prisma Illya the Movie Licht- The Nameless Girl\n\n54 Spider-Man: No Way Home\n\n55 The Matrix: Resurrections\n\n56 The King's Man\n\n57 Sing 2\n\n58 Emergency Declaration\n\n59 Peter Rabbit 2: The Runaway\n\nMade 24 December 2021\n\n[Perb.MOF.TAX(S)700-1/3/27 JLD.2(15); PN(PU2)174/XI]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n\nMinister of Finance"}}],"pack":"my-14"};
  FT["MY-H6238"] = {"id":"MY-H6238","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 492/2012&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年马来西亚存款保险机构（合格第三方的标准）令","en":"MALAYSIA DEPOSIT INSURANCE CORPORATION (CRITERIA IN RESPECT OF QUALIFIED THIRD PARTY) ORDER 2012","orig":"MALAYSIA DEPOSIT INSURANCE CORPORATION (CRITERIA IN RESPECT OF QUALIFIED THIRD PARTY) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Perbadanan Insurans Deposit Malaysia (Kriteria bagi Pihak Ketiga Layak) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Tổng công ty Bảo hiểm Tiền gửi Malaysia (Tiêu chí đối với bên thứ ba đủ điều kiện) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งองค์การประกันเงินฝากมาเลเซีย (เกณฑ์เกี่ยวกับบุคคลภายนอกที่เข้าเกณฑ์) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Lembaga Penjamin Simpanan Malaysia (Kriteria Pihak Ketiga yang Memenuhi Syarat) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA492","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2012_P.U.(A)492-2012_MALAYSIA DEPOSIT INSURANCE CORPORATION (CRITERIA IN RESPECT OF QUALIFIED THIRD PARTY) ORDER 201.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6238-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah in i bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Perbadanan Insurans\nDeposit Malaysia (Kriteria berkenaan dengan Pihak Ketiga yang Layak) 2012.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada  2 Januari 2013.\n\nKriteria pihak ketiga yang layak"}},{"id":"MY-H6238-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2.  Pihak ketiga yang layak  yang berkenaan dengannya  Perbadanan memindahkan,\natau mengesahkan melalui notis bertulis bahawa ia akan memindahkan di bawah\nsubseksyen 115(3) Akta, atau menyetujui pemindahan di bawah subseksyen 180(2)\nAkta, mana-mana pe rjanjian yang disebut dalam subseksyen 115(1) Akta, hendaklah\nmerupakan:\n\n(a) suatu institusi yang\n\n(i) dilesenkan di bawah Akta Bank dan Institusi -Institusi Kewangan\n1989 [Akta 372];\n\n(ii) dilesenkan di bawah Akta Bank Islam 1983 [Akta 276];\n\n(iii) dilesenkan di bawah Akta Insurans 1996 [Akta 553];\n\n(iv) didaftarkan di bawah Akta Takaful 1984 [Akta 312]; atau\n\n(v) ditetapkan di bawah Akta Institusi Kewangan Pembangunan 2002\n[Akta 618];\n\ndan mesti mematuh i keperluan modal dan keperluan berhemat yang\nditetapkan oleh Bank Negara Malaysia;\n\n(b) suatu institusi yang dilesenkan di bawah Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan\ndan Sekuriti Labuan 2010  [Akta 704] atau Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan\ndan Sekuriti Islam Labuan 2010  [Akta 705], dan mesti  mematu hi\nkeperluan modal dan keperluan berhemat  yang ditetapkan oleh Lembaga\nPerkhidmatan Kewangan Labuan;\n\n(c) suatu badan berkanun; atau\n\n(d) suatu entiti yang mana kewajipannya d i bawah perjanjian yang di sebut\ndalam subseksyen 115(1) Akta  akan dijamin oleh Kerajaan Malaysia,\nBank Negara Malaysia atau Perbadanan.\n\nDibuat 6 Disember 2012\n[PIDM/PN/2/2012; PN(PU2)689/II]\n\nTAN SRI DATUK DR ABDUL SAMAD HAJI ALIAS\nPengerusi\nPerbadanan Insurans Deposit Malaysia\n\nDiluluskan 28 Disember 2012\n[KK/BPKA/K2/(S)/382/342/3-1;PN(PU2)689/II]\n\n             DATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n       Menteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 209(4) Akta Perbadanan\nInsurans Deposit Malaysia 2011]\n\nMALAYSIA DEPOSIT INSURANCE CORPORATION ACT 2011\n\nMALAYSIA DEPOSIT INSURANCE CORPORATION\n(CRITERIA IN RESPECT OF QUALIFIED THIRD PARTY) ORDER 2012\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 209(1) (a) of the Malaysia Deposit\nInsurance Corporation Act 2011 [Act 720], the Corporation with the Minister's approval\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-14"};
