  FT["MY-H6506"] = {"id":"MY-H6506","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 64/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年国家遗产（国家遗产宣告）（遗产物）令","en":"NATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF NATIONAL HERITAGE) (HERITAGE OBJECT) ORDER 2016","orig":"NATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF NATIONAL HERITAGE) (HERITAGE OBJECT) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Warisan Negara (Pengisytiharan Warisan Negara) (Objek Warisan) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Di sản quốc gia (Tuyên bố di sản quốc gia) (Di vật di sản) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งมรดกแห่งชาติ (การประกาศมรดกแห่งชาติ) (วัตถุมรดก) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Warisan Nasional (Penetapan Warisan Nasional) (Benda Warisan) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA64","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2016_P.U.(A)64-2016_NATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF NATIONAL HERITAGE) (HERITAGE OBJECT) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6506-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Warisan Kebangsaan\n\n(Perisytiharan Warisan Kebangsaan) (Objek Warisan) 2016.\n\nWarisan Kebangsaan"}},{"id":"MY-H6506-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Objek yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual yang telah diisytiharkan sebagai\n\nobjek warisan dalam Pengisytiharan Objek Warisan 2008 [P.U. (B) 439/2008] yang\n\ndisiarkan dalam Warta pada 13 November 2008 dan disenaraikan dalam Daftar\n\ndiisytiharkan sebagai Warisan Kebangsaan.\n\nJADUAL\n\n1. Adat Cukur Jambul (Kaum Melayu)\n\n2. Berkhatan/Bersunat Anak-anak Melayu\n\n3. Buka Tanah Baru (Iban Sarawak)\n\n4. Melenggang Perut (Kaum Melayu)\n\n5. Batu Seremban\n\n6. Dam Haji\n\n7. Galah Panjang\n\n8. Ketinting\n\n9. Konda Kondi\n\n10. Sepak Raga Bulatan\n\n11. Bongai\n\n12. Dabus\n\n13. Datun Julud\n\n14. Ghazal\n\n15. Rodat\n\n16. Tarian Topeng Mah Meri (Mayin Jooh)\n\n17. Tarian Ulik Mayang\n\nDATO' SERI MOHAMED NAZRI BIN TAN SRI ABDUL AZIZ\n\nMenteri Pelancongan dan Kebudayaan\n\nBertarikh 10 Februari 2016\n\n[JWN.PP.600/3/51/1/2; PN(PU2)652/XII]\n\nNATIONAL HERITAGE ACT 2005\n\nNATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF NATIONAL HERITAGE)\n\n(HERITAGE OBJECT) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 67(1) of the\n\nNational Heritage Act 2005 [Act 645], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the National Heritage (Declaration of National\n\nHeritage) (Heritage Object) Order 2016.\n\nNational Heritage\n\n2. The objects specified in the Schedule that have been declared as heritage objects in\n\nthe Declaration of Heritage Object 2008 [P.U. (B) 439/2008] as published in the Gazette\n\non 13 November 2008 and listed in the Register are declared to be National Heritage.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Shave Off Forelock (Malay)\n\n2. Circumcision/Malay Children Circumcision\n\n3. Opening of New Land (Sarawak's Ibans)\n\n4. Stomach Swings (Malay)\n\n5. Batu Seremban\n\n6. Haj Checkers\n\n7. Long Galley\n\n8. Ketinting\n\n9. Konda Kondi\n\n10. Circle of Sepak Raga\n\n11. Bongai\n\n12. Dabus\n\n13. Datun Julud\n\n14. Ghazal\n\n15. Rodat\n\n16. Mah Meri Mask Dance (Mayin Jooh)\n\n17. Ulik Mayang Dance\n\nDated 10 February 2016\n\n[JWN.PP.600/3/51/1/2; PN(PU2)652/XII]\n\nDATO' SERI MOHAMED NAZRI BIN TAN SRI ABDUL AZIZ\n\nMinister of Tourism and Culture"}}],"pack":"my-14"};
  FT["MY-H6507"] = {"id":"MY-H6507","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 64/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年费用（国家航天局）令","en":"FEES (NATIONAL SPACE AGENCY) ORDER 2017","orig":"FEES (NATIONAL SPACE AGENCY) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Fi (Agensi Angkasa Negara) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Phí (Cơ quan Vũ trụ Quốc gia) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งค่าธรรมเนียม (องค์การอวกาศแห่งชาติ) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Biaya (Badan Antariksa Nasional) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA64","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2017_P.U.(A)64-2017_FEES (NATIONAL SPACE AGENCY) ORDER 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6507-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1)  Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Fi (Agensi Angkasa Negara)\n\n  (2)   Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Mac 2017.\n\nFi dan pembayaran"}},{"id":"MY-H6507-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1)  Fi yang ditetapkan dalam ruang (2) Jadual hendakla h dibayar kepada\nKetua Pengarah  Agensi Angkasa Negara bagi perkhidmatan yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) mengikut unit yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3).\n\n(2) Fi yang d itetapkan di bawah Perintah ini  hendaklah dibayar seperti yang\nberikut:\n\n(a) tidak kurang daripada lima puluh peratus daripada jumlah fi yang\nkena dibayar hendaklah dibayar sebelum perkhidmatan diberikan;\ndan\n\n(b) baki fi yang kena dibayar  selepas bayaran di bawah\nsubsubperenggan (a) dibuat, hendaklah dibayar sepenuhnya\nselepas perkhidmatan diberikan.\n\nRemitan"}},{"id":"MY-H6507-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Ketua Pengarah Agensi Angkasa Negara boleh meremitkan fi yang ditetapkan\ndi bawah Perintah ini sama ada secara keseluruhan atau sebahagian atau secara am\natau dalam mana-mana kes atau kelas kes yang tertentu.\n\nJADUAL\n\n(1)\nPerkhidmatan\n(2)\nFi\n(RM)\n(3)\nUnit\n1. Penjejakan, kawalan dan t elemetri objek\nangkasa\n3,250.00 sehari\n2. Penentukuran dan pencirian radiometrik\n\n(a) menggunakan sfera integrasi\n\n(b) menggunakan lampu piawaian\n\n(c) menggunakan kedua-dua sfera\nintegrasi dan lampu piawaian\n\n1,780.00\n\n1,770.00\n\n2,040.00\n\nsehari\n\nsehari\n\nsehari\n3. Pengujian gangguan elektromagnetik/\nkeserasian elektromagnetik\n\n(a) ujian kelakuan emisi\n\n(b) ujian kelakuan kerentanan\n\n(c) ujian emisi terpancar\n\n(d) ujian imuniti terpancar\n\n2,070.00\n\n2,140.00\n\n2,080.00\n\n2,100.00\n\nsehari\n\nsehari\n\nsehari\n\nsehari\n4. Pengujian getaran\n\n(a) menggunakan sistem V9\n\n(b) menggunakan sistem V994\n\n4,560.00\n\n5,080.00\n\nsehari\n\nsehari\n5. Pengujian gema akustik 3,880.00 sehari\n6. Pengujian terma vakum 3,660.00 sehari\n7. Pengukuran perihal jisim 3,260.00 sehari\n8. Pengukuran penjajaran 2,490.00 sehari\n\n(1)\nPerkhidmatan\n(2)\nFi\n(RM)\n(3)\nUnit\n9. Sewaan ruang\n\n(a) makmal bilik bersih\n\n(b) bilik kawalan misi\n\n(c) ruang kawalan habuk\n\n10.00\n\n8.00\n\n8.00\n\nsemeter persegi\n\nsemeter persegi\n\nsemeter persegi\n10. Sewaan sensor\n\n(a) akselerometer paksian tunggal\n\n(b) akselerometer paksian  tiga\n\n(c) thermocouple jenis-T\n\n50.00\n\n80.00\n\n20.00\n\nseunit\n\nseunit\n\nseunit\n11. Pengendalian untuk simulator g erakan/\nsimulator solar\n1,500.00 sehari\nNota: Sehari ertinya lapan jam (bermula dari jam 9.00 pagi hingga jam 5.00 petang)\npada hari bekerja di Negeri Selangor.\n\nDibuat 6 Oktober 2016\n[AAN/PAN/650-6(22); PN(PU2)86/XXII]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah\n\nTAN SRI DR ALI HAMSA\nSetiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\n[Akan dibentangkan dalam Dewan Rakyat menurut seksyen 4 Akta Fi 1951]\n\nFEES ACT 1951\n\nFEES (NATIONAL SPACE AGENCY) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by sections 3 and 10 of the Fees Act 1951\n[Act 209], the Yang di-Pertuan Agong makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Fees (National Space Agency)\nOrder 2017.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 March 2017.\n\nFees and payment of fees\n2. (1) The fees prescribed in  column (2) of  the Schedule shall be paid to the\nDirector General of the National Space Agency for the services specified in column (1)\nin accordance with the unit specified in column (3).\n\n(2) The fees prescribed under this Order shall be payable as follows:\n\n(a) not less than fifty percent from the total fees payable  shall be paid\nbefore the services are rendered; and\n\n(b)  the remaining fees payable  after payment in subsubparagraph (a)\nis made, shall be paid in full after the services have been rendered.\n\nRemission\n3. The Director General of the National Space Agency may remit the fees prescribed\nunder this Order either wholly or in part or generally or in any particular case or class\nof cases.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n(1)\nServices\n(2)\nFees\n(RM)\n(3)\nUnit\n1. Tracking, control and telemetry of space\nobjects\n3,250.00 per day\n2. Radiometric calibration and\ncharacterization\n\n(a) using integrating sphere\n\n(b) using standard lamps\n\n(c) using both i ntegrating sphere and\nstandard lamps\n\n1,780.00\n\n1,770.00\n\n2,040.00\n\nper day\n\nper day\n\nper day\n3. Electromagnetic interference/\nelectromagnetic compatibility test\n\n(a) conducted emission test\n\n(b) conducted susceptibility test\n\n(c) radiated emission test\n\n(d) radiated susceptibility test\n\n2,070.00\n\n2,140.00\n\n2,080.00\n\n2,100.00\n\nper day\n\nper day\n\nper day\n\nper day\n\n4. Vibration test\n\n(a) using V9 system\n\n(b) using V994 system\n\n4,560.00\n\n5,080.00\n\nper day\n\nper day\n\n5. Reverberation acoustic test 3,880.00 per day\n6. Thermal vacuum test 3,660.00 per day\n7. Mass properties measurement 3,260.00 per day\n8. Alignment measurement 2,490.00 per day\n\n(1)\nServices\n(2)\nFees\n(RM)\n(3)\nUnit\n9. Rental of space\n\n(a) clean room facility occupation\n\n(b) mission operation room\n\n(c) dust control area\n\n10.00\n\n8.00\n\n8.00\n\nper square meter\n\nper square meter\n\nper square meter\n10. Rental of sensor\n\n(a) single axial accelerometer\n\n(b) tri-axial accelerometer\n\n(c) thermocouple type-T\n\n50.00\n\n80.00\n\n20.00\n\nper unit\n\nper unit\n\nper unit\n11. Handling for m otion simulator/solar\nsimulator\n1,500.00 per day\n\nNote: Per day means eight hours (from 9.00 a.m. until 5.00 p.m.) on the working day in\nthe State of Selangor.\n\nMade 6 October 2016\n[AAN/PAN/650-6(22); PN(PU2)86/XXII]\n\nBy Command\n\nTAN SRI DR ALI HAMSA\nSecretary to the Cabinet\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to section 4 of the Fees Act 1951]"}}],"pack":"my-14"};
